  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Financial aid/grant to Government of the Punjab for training through Punjab Skills Development Fund is a component of Punjab Economic Opportunities Programme (PEOP) reported by FCDO with a funding type of 108 - Non-budget support financial aid and a budget of &#xA3;24,300,001. It works in the following sector(s): Vocational training, Advanced technical and managerial training, Public sector policy and administrative management, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
